                                            </div>

                                            <h2 class="h5">More on Naltrexone</h2>

<p>From the American Journal of Psychiatry</p>

<ul>
	<li><a href="https://psychiatryonline.org/doi/full/10.1176/appi.ajp.20220821" target="_blank">Naltrexone and Alcohol Use</a> (commentary)</li>
	<li><a href="https://psychiatryonline.org/doi/10.1176/appi.ajp.20220335" target="_blank">Targeted Oral Naltrexone for Mild to Moderate Alcohol Use Disorder</a> Among Sexual and Gender Minority Men: A Randomized Trial</li>
</ul>
                                    </div>

                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <div class="c-card c-card--no-image c-card--bg--white c-card--b--l c-card--b--l--tertiary--wine" role="group" aria-label="card">

